        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset C, Classic Copa Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handsomely styled Copa design fits any type of home from colonial to contemporary and every style in between. Easy to install, it fits all pre-drilled doors. The Kwikset Copa Knob has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for doors 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Traditional Copa Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits all pre-driled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick 6 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>10 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Copa Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Copa Door Knob Set, Kwikset C",
                "description": "Kwikset C, Copa Knobset - The handsomely styled Copa design fits any type of home from colonial to contemporary and every style in between. Easy to install, it fits all pre-drilled doors. The Kwikset Copa Knob has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for doors 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating.",
